      <title>Screenshotter 0.9.0</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 09:17:34 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>0.9.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.9.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://screenshotter-umber.vercel.app/changelog.html</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
      <description><![CDATA[<style>body{font:13px -apple-system,system-ui;line-height:1.45;color:#1d1d1f}h4{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:#6e6e73;margin:14px 0 4px}ul{padding-left:18px;margin:0}li{margin:4px 0}code{font:12px ui-monospace,monospace}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#f5f5f7}h4{color:#a1a1a6}}</style><h4>Highlights</h4>
<ul>
<li><strong>Updates, built in.</strong> Screenshotter now checks for a new version once a day and offers it with its notes: one click downloads it, installs it and relaunches. <strong>Screenshotter › Check for Updates…</strong> looks right away. Every update is signed by us and notarized by Apple, and is checked before it installs. This version is the last you need to download by hand.</li>
<li><strong>Drag in stickers, badges and awards.</strong> Everything in the Images panel drags onto the design and lands where you let go (a click still adds it in its usual place).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
